  description : TEXT
  template : TEXT <<NULL = Draft>>
  * verification_type : ENUM('auto',\n'manual','document')
  requirements_info : TEXT
  assigned_role : ENUM('kasi_pelayanan',\n'kaur_tu_umum') <<NULL>>
  validity_days : INT <<NULL = tidak expire>>
  * category_id : BIGINT <<FK -> letter_categories, NOT NULL>>
  * flow_id : BIGINT <<FK -> approval_flows, NOT NULL>>
  * is_active : BOOLEAN
  created_at : TIMESTAMP
  updated_at : TIMESTAMP
}

note right of LT
  PATCH v5.0: tambah category_id (FK,
  NOT NULL) dan flow_id (FK, NOT NULL -
  selalu diisi termasuk untuk category
  non-approval_normal, demi konsistensi).
  ---
  assigned_role (peninggalan v4.2):
  DIPERTAHANKAN sebagai kolom derived/
  cache untuk kompatibilitas mundur -
  BUKAN lagi source of truth. Source of
  truth resmi soal "siapa approver di
  step mana" adalah flow_steps.
  approver_position (SID-ARCH-BE-001 S4.2).
  Policy WAJIB validasi lewat flow_steps,
  bukan assigned_role langsung.
  ---
  Status: template=NULL + is_active=false
          = Draft
  MVP: Petugas Desa hanya edit
  validity_days, assigned_role,
  toggle is_active (UC-21 sederhana).
  Full CRUD + WYSIWYG = Next Dev Paket 1
  (letter_type_fields/letter_field_values
