title Class Diagram [1/2: CORE] - SID Desa Cibenda (v5.0)\nLayer: Controller -> Form Request -> Service -> Repository -> Eloquent Model -> DB (Policy di sisi Service, lihat SID-ARCH-BE-001 S2)\nScope: Wilayah, Pengguna & Jabatan Struktural, Kependudukan (Citizens+Families+Socioeconomics), Pipeline Approval Dinamis, Surat\nLihat file Class Diagram Pendukung [2/2] untuk: Organisasi Non-Struktural, Notifikasi, Berita, Peraturan Desa

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' LAYER 1: CONTROLLER
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

package "Controller Layer" #F0F4FF {

  class AuthController {
    +register(RegisterRequest) : JsonResponse
    +login(LoginRequest) : JsonResponse
    +logout() : JsonResponse
    +me() : JsonResponse
  }

  class LetterController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +show(id) : JsonResponse
    +store(StoreLetterRequest) : JsonResponse
    +downloadPdf(id) : BinaryFileResponse
    note right
      index()/show(): dipakai Warga
      (scope: citizen_id miliknya) dan
      Petugas Desa (scope: full visibility,
      SEMUA status termasuk rejected
      di step manapun).
    end note
  }

  class RtApprovalController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +show(id) : JsonResponse
    +decision(id, DecisionRequest) : JsonResponse
    note right
      TETAP TERPISAH (tidak digabung ke
      FlowStepApprovalController) karena
      RT resolve BERBASIS WILAYAH (rt_id),
      pola query & otorisasi beda dengan
      approver berbasis posisi murni.
    end note
  }

  class FlowStepApprovalController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +show(id) : JsonResponse
    +decision(id, DecisionRequest) : JsonResponse
    note right
      *** BARU v5.0 - PENGGANTI GENERIK ***
      Menggantikan RwApprovalController
      (DIHAPUS - RW bukan approver),
      KadusApprovalController (DIHAPUS -
      Kadus bukan approver), dan
      KasiApprovalController (DIGABUNG ke
      sini). SATU controller melayani
      SEMUA approver berbasis posisi murni:
      kepala_desa, sekdes, kasi_pelayanan,
      kaur_tu_umum. Route/middleware
      menyaring role di layer otorisasi,
      bukan class Controller terpisah
      per role (Config over Code,
      SID-ARCH-SYS-001 S1).
    end note
  }

  class CitizenController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +store(StoreCitizenRequest) : JsonResponse
    +update(id, UpdateCitizenRequest) : JsonResponse
    +importExcel(ImportExcelRequest) : JsonResponse
  }

  class FamilyController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +store(StoreFamilyRequest) : JsonResponse
    +update(id, UpdateFamilyRequest) : JsonResponse
    +addMember(id, AddFamilyMemberRequest) : JsonResponse
    note right
      BARU v5.0. Kelola Kartu Keluarga
      (families) - terpisah dari
      CitizenController karena families
      adalah entity tersendiri sejak
      restrukturisasi kependudukan v5.0.
    end note
  }

  class UserManagementController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +store(StoreUserRequest) : JsonResponse
    +update(id, UpdateUserRequest) : JsonResponse
    +rotateOfficial(id, RotateOfficialRequest) : JsonResponse
    +deactivate(id) : JsonResponse
  }

  class RegionController {
    +manageHamlets() : JsonResponse
    +manageRws() : JsonResponse
    +manageRts() : JsonResponse
  }

  class ApprovalSettingController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +update(id, UpdateSettingRequest) : JsonResponse
  }

  class LetterTypeController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +update(id, UpdateLetterTypeRequest) : JsonResponse
    note right
      MVP: hanya edit validity_days,
      assigned_role, toggle is_active
      (UC-21 versi sederhana).
      category_id/flow_id: developer-only
      via seeder di MVP, TIDAK ada endpoint
      edit untuk keduanya.
    end note
  }

  class ApprovalFlowController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +show(id) : JsonResponse
    note right
      BARU v5.0, READ-ONLY di MVP.
      Untuk keperluan Frontend menampilkan
      struktur flow (misal preview alur
      approval suatu tipe surat).
      CRUD letter_categories/approval_flows/
      flow_steps TETAP developer-only via
      seeder/migration di MVP - TIDAK ada
      endpoint create/update/delete di sini.
    end note
  }
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' LAYER 2: SERVICE (Business Logic)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

package "Service Layer" #D5EAD0 {

  class AuthService {
    +registerWarga(data) : User
    +attemptLogin(credentials) : User
    -hashNik(nik) : string
  }

  class LetterService {
    +getActiveLetterTypes() : Collection
    +createLetter(data, user) : Letter
    +processRtDecision(id, action, notes, actorId) : Letter
    +processStepDecision(id, action, notes, actorId, approverPosition) : Letter
    +validateStepAccess(id, approverPosition) : bool
    +generateLetterNumber(typeCode) : string
    +calculateExpiresAt(from, validityDays) : Carbon
    +getLetterDetailWithFullHistory(id) : Letter
    -advanceToNextStep(letter) : void
    -isCurrentStepFinal(letter) : bool
    note right
      *** PERUBAHAN UTAMA v5.0 ***
      processRwDecision(), processKadusDecision(),
      processKasiDecision(), validateRwAccess(),
      validateKadusAccess() SEMUA DIHAPUS.
      Digantikan SATU method generik
      processStepDecision() yang menerima
      approverPosition sbg parameter - dipakai
      untuk Kepala Desa/Sekdes/Kasi/Kaur
      sekaligus. RT tetap method terpisah
      (processRtDecision) karena basis
