title Sequence Diagram - Input Permohonan Surat [v5.0] \n(Warga Self-Service -> Snapshot Flow -> Notifikasi ke RT, Step 1)

actor "Warga\n(Self-Service)" as WRG
participant "React\nFrontend" as FE
participant "LetterController" as CTRL
participant "AuthController" as AUTHCTRL
participant "Form\nRequest" as FREQ
participant "LetterService" as SVC
participant "OfficialService" as OSVC
participant "LetterTypeRepository" as LTREPO
participant "ApprovalFlowRepository" as AFREPO
participant "UserRepository" as UREPO
participant "LetterRepository" as REPO
participant "OfficialRepository" as OREPO
participant "DB::transaction" as TX
participant "Queue\n(Jobs)" as Q
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
actor "RT\n(Wilayah Warga)" as RT

== Buka Form & Pilih Jenis Surat ==

WRG -> FE : Buka menu "Ajukan Permohonan Surat"
FE -> CTRL : GET /api/letter-types?active=true
CTRL -> SVC : getActiveLetterTypes()
SVC -> LTREPO : findAllActive()
LTREPO -> DB : SELECT * FROM letter_types\nWHERE is_active = true\nAND template IS NOT NULL
note right of DB
  TIDAK BERUBAH dari v4.2: filter
  template IS NOT NULL. Tipe surat
  dengan template = NULL (status:
  Draft) tidak boleh tampil untuk warga.
end note
DB --> LTREPO : collection letter_types
LTREPO --> SVC : collection
SVC --> CTRL : LetterTypeCollection
CTRL --> FE : 200 OK {letter_types[]}
FE --> WRG : Tampilkan pilihan jenis surat

WRG -> FE : Pilih jenis surat
FE -> CTRL : GET /api/letter-types/{id}
CTRL -> SVC : getLetterTypeDetail(id)
SVC -> LTREPO : findById(id)
LTREPO -> DB : SELECT * FROM letter_types WHERE id = ?
DB --> LTREPO : letter_type\n(verification_type, requirements_info,\nassigned_role, validity_days,\ncategory_id, flow_id)
note right of DB
  v5.0: letter_type kini membawa
  category_id & flow_id (FK NOT NULL
  keduanya) - dipakai nanti sebagai
  SUMBER SNAPSHOT saat surat disubmit.
end note
LTREPO --> SVC : letter_type
SVC --> CTRL : LetterTypeResource
CTRL --> FE : 200 OK {letter_type detail}

alt verification_type = "auto"
  FE --> WRG : Tampilkan form langsung\n(NIK otomatis tervalidasi dari akun)
else verification_type = "manual"
  FE --> WRG : Tampilkan checklist persyaratan\n(warga wajib konfirmasi kelengkapan)
else verification_type = "document"
  FE --> WRG : Tampilkan form + field\nupload dokumen pendukung (wajib)
end

== Ambil Data Warga dari Session ==

FE -> AUTHCTRL : GET /api/auth/me
AUTHCTRL -> UREPO : findByIdWithCitizen(auth()->id())
UREPO -> DB : SELECT users.*, citizens.*\nFROM users\nLEFT JOIN citizens\nON users.citizen_id = citizens.id\nWHERE users.id = ?
DB --> UREPO : user + citizen data\n(termasuk family_id, residency_type\njika relevan ditampilkan)
UREPO --> AUTHCTRL : user model (dengan relasi citizen)
AUTHCTRL --> FE : 200 OK {nama, nik_masked, alamat,\nrt_id, hamlet_id}
FE --> WRG : Form terisi otomatis: nama, alamat\n(dari akun login)\nWarga hanya isi: keperluan, catatan

note right of FE
  TIDAK BERUBAH dari v4.2. Tidak ada
  step "input NIK manual". Data warga
  diambil dari auth()->user()->citizen
  (sudah terautentikasi).
end note

== Submit Permohonan ==

WRG -> FE : Lengkapi form & klik Submit
FE -> CTRL : POST /api/letters\n{letter_type_id, purpose, notes,\n dokumen (jika document type)}
CTRL -> FREQ : validate(request)

alt Validasi Gagal
  FREQ --> CTRL : ValidationException
  CTRL --> FE : 422 {errors per field}
  FE --> WRG : Tampilkan pesan error per field

else Validasi Berhasil
  FREQ --> CTRL : validated data

  CTRL -> SVC : createLetter(data, auth()->user())

  == Snapshot Flow Sebelum Simpan (BARU v5.0) ==

  SVC -> LTREPO : findById(data.letter_type_id)
  LTREPO -> DB : SELECT * FROM letter_types WHERE id = ?
  DB --> LTREPO : letter_type (flow_id, category_id)
  LTREPO --> SVC : letter_type

  SVC -> AFREPO : findWithSteps(letter_type.flow_id)
  AFREPO -> DB : SELECT * FROM approval_flows\nWHERE id = ?;\nSELECT * FROM flow_steps\nWHERE flow_id = ?\nORDER BY step_order
  DB --> AFREPO : flow + steps terurut
  AFREPO --> SVC : ApprovalFlow (dengan steps)
  note right of SVC
    *** BARU v5.0 ***
    flow_id yang akan disimpan ke
    letters.flow_id adalah SNAPSHOT,
    DIKUNCI saat ini juga. Jika admin
    ubah konfigurasi flow di letter_types
    di kemudian hari, surat yang sudah
    berjalan TIDAK terpengaruh/nyasar
    (SID-ARCH-BE-001 S3.2).
  end note

  SVC -> TX : DB::transaction() begin

  TX -> REPO : create(letterData)
  note right of REPO
    citizen_id   = auth()->user()->citizen_id
    submitted_by = auth()->user()->id (role: warga)
    applicant_nik_hash = SHA-256(nik plaintext)
    applicant_nik = AES-256 encrypt(nik)
    status = 'pending'              <<GENERIK v5.0>>
    flow_id = letter_type.flow_id   <<SNAPSHOT, BARU v5.0>>
    current_step_order = 1          <<BARU v5.0>>
    rejected_at_step = NULL         <<BARU v5.0>>
    submitted_at = now()
    is_overdue = false
    expires_at = NULL (diisi nanti saat\nstep is_final=true di-approve)
  end note
  note right of REPO
    Blockchain-inspired hashing TETAP
    dikeluarkan dari MVP (Next Dev
    Paket 2). Tidak ada proses hashing
    di alur ini. TIDAK BERUBAH dari v4.2.
  end note
  REPO -> DB : INSERT INTO letters
  DB --> REPO : letter model (id, ...)

  TX -> REPO : createStatusLog({\n  letter_id, actor_id,\n  old_status: NULL,\n  new_status: 'pending', ip_address\n})
  REPO -> DB : INSERT INTO letter_status_logs
  DB --> REPO : log created

  TX --> SVC : letter created (commit)

  == Resolve RT Wilayah Warga (Step 1, Berbasis Wilayah) ==

  SVC -> OSVC : resolveRtForCitizen(citizen)
  note right of OSVC
    TIDAK BERUBAH dari v4.2: resolve
    berdasarkan citizens.rt_id (FK ->
    rts.id). Step 1 SELALU RT untuk
    kategori approval_normal - ini
    ditentukan oleh flow_steps
    step_order=1, approver_position='rt'
    (bukan lagi hardcode di kode).
  end note
  OSVC -> OREPO : findActiveByRtId(citizen.rt_id)
  OREPO -> DB : SELECT * FROM officials\nWHERE rt_id = ?\nAND position = 'rt'\nAND is_active = true\nAND ended_at IS NULL
  DB --> OREPO : official RT | null
  OREPO --> OSVC : Official RT | null

  alt RT wilayah ditemukan
    OSVC --> SVC : Official RT (user_id)

    SVC -> SVC : hitung deadline_at\n(dari approval_settings\nWHERE approval_level='rt')

    SVC -> REPO : createApprovalPlaceholder(\n  letter_id, approval_level: 'rt',\n  flow_step_id, deadline_at\n)
    note right of REPO
      flow_step_id (BARU v5.0): referensi
      eksplisit ke row flow_steps step 1
      milik flow surat ini - untuk audit
      trail granular.
    end note

    SVC -> Q : dispatch(SendNotificationJob -> RT)
    Q -> OREPO : createNotification({\n  notifiable_id: RT.user_id,\n  data: {letter_id, pesan}\n})
    OREPO -> DB : INSERT INTO notifications
    DB --> OREPO : notification created
    Q --> RT : Notifikasi in-app + email:\n"Ada permohonan surat baru\ndari warga wilayahmu"

  else RT wilayah tidak ditemukan / jabatan kosong
    OSVC --> SVC : null
    SVC -> Q : dispatch(SendNotificationJob -> Semua Petugas Desa)
    note right of Q
      Fallback broadcast: notif ke SEMUA
      petugas_desa aktif untuk penanganan
      manual (jabatan RT kosong / belum
      diisi). TIDAK BERUBAH dari v4.2.
    end note
    Q -> UREPO : createNotificationBroadcast({\n  notifiable: semua petugas_desa aktif\n})
    UREPO -> DB : INSERT INTO notifications\n(multiple rows)
    DB --> UREPO : notifications created
  end

  SVC --> CTRL : LetterResource
  CTRL --> FE : 201 Created {letter data, status: 'pending',\ncurrent_step_order: 1}
  FE --> WRG : "Permohonan berhasil dikirim!\nSilakan pantau status di Dashboard."
end

@enduml

'==================================================================================
' CATATAN REVISI: 01_Sequence_InputSurat_v4.puml -> 01_Sequence_InputSurat_v5.puml
'==================================================================================
'
' TIDAK BERUBAH: alur pemilihan jenis surat, pengambilan data warga dari
'   session, validasi form, resolve RT berbasis wilayah (citizens.rt_id),
'   fallback broadcast RT kosong, enkripsi NIK, dan seluruh mekanisme
'   verification_type (auto/manual/document).
'
' PERUBAHAN:
'   - TAMBAH interaksi baru "Snapshot Flow Sebelum Simpan": sebelum
'     DB::transaction(), Service kini WAJIB fetch letter_type.flow_id
'     lalu load ApprovalFlow beserta flow_steps-nya (via
'     ApprovalFlowRepository::findWithSteps()) - untuk memastikan flow_id
'     yang disimpan ke letters.flow_id adalah snapshot yang valid dan
'     dikunci pada saat submit ini juga.
'   - Data yang di-INSERT ke letters berubah: status kini 'pending' sebagai
'     nilai ENUM GENERIK (4 nilai: pending/in_progress/approved/rejected),
'     BUKAN lagi bagian dari status granular. TAMBAH flow_id (snapshot)
'     dan current_step_order=1, rejected_at_step=NULL sebagai kolom baru.
'   - createApprovalPlaceholder() kini juga menyertakan flow_step_id
'     (BARU v5.0) sebagai referensi granular ke step 1 milik flow surat.
'   - Response 201 Created kini eksplisit menyertakan current_step_order:1
'     di payload, bukan hanya status.
'
'==================================================================================
'=========== END FILE: 01_Sequence_InputSurat_v5.puml ===========


